Upstream Origin and Attribution

This project is a Flutter port inspired by and derived from
ShadowBitBasher/DJI-Mic-Control (v1.1.0, commit 9ba7688), originally released
into the public domain under The Unlicense:
https://github.com/ShadowBitBasher/DJI-Mic-Control

Mobile Receiver identification, Receiver/Monitoring Gain controls, and
Simplified Chinese (zh-CN) UI localization are ported from upstream pull
requests #3 and #4 authored by VaderCheng:
- https://github.com/ShadowBitBasher/DJI-Mic-Control/pull/3
- https://github.com/ShadowBitBasher/DJI-Mic-Control/pull/4
